body:
In order to make templating very easy and well done, we could provide a way to load the template from a URL. The code could look like : 

``` js
var template = InstantSearch.templateLoader;

search.addWidget(instantsearch.widgets.hits({
    container: '#hits',
    templates: {
      empty: 'No results',
      hit: template('./templates/hit.html')
    },
    hitsPerPage: 6
}));
```
